            "review_1_photo": "shopify://shop_images/Recens_2.webp",
            "review_1_name": "Ashley",
            "review_1_rating": "5",
            "review_1_title": "",
            "review_1_text": "Okay, I was 100% ready to return this. I’ve been scammed by 'booty lifters' before that just made me look like I had a diaper on. But girls... my boyfriend literally stopped mid-sentence when I walked out in my leggings. He asked if I’d been doing secret glute workouts. The 'allegations' are real. The only thing is, it’s a bit of a workout to get into the first time, but once it’s on? Snatched. I’m literally throwing my other shapers away.",
            "review_2_photo": "shopify://shop_images/Recens_4.webp",
            "review_2_name": "Sofia",
            "review_2_rating": "5",
            "review_2_title": "",
            "review_2_text": "Sofia\nI have this one 'impossible' beige bodycon dress that shows everything. Every other shaper left a huge line across my mid-thigh. I bought this as a last resort. I don't know what kind of witchcraft this 'Jelly-Sculpt' is, but the edges are literally invisible. You can see the faint outline of the tag if you really look for it, so I just cut it off. Problem solved. It’s the first time I’ve felt confident in beige since 2019.",
            "review_3_photo": "shopify://shop_images/Recens_3.webp",
            "review_3_name": "Jayda",
            "review_3_rating": "5",
            "review_3_title": "",
            "review_3_text": "I’m an office girlie, so I’m sitting for 8 hours then going to happy hour. Usually, by 2 PM, I’m dying to rip my shapewear off because it digs into my ribs. I wore the LeiShape yesterday for a 12-hour shift plus dinner. I actually forgot I had it on until I got home. It’s wild because it looks so tight, but it breathes. It did leave a tiny red mark on my thigh because I pulled it too high, but that’s on me. Already ordered the nude one.",
            "review_4_photo": "shopify://shop_images/Recens6.webp",
            "review_4_name": "Sarah",
            "review_4_rating": "5",
            "review_4_title": "",
            "review_4_text": "If you’re a mom, you know the struggle of having to get completely naked in a public stall just to pee while wearing shapewear. I almost didn't buy this because it's pricier than the Amazon ones, but the snap access is a game changer. I used it at a wedding last weekend—zero struggle. The zipper is a little stiff at first, but it gets easier. Totally worth the extra $30 just for the sanity it saves you in the bathroom.",
            "review_5_photo": "shopify://shop_images/recens_7.webp",
            "review_5_name": "Noemi",
            "review_5_rating": "5",
            "review_5_title": "",
            "review_5_text": "I used to buy a new $20 shaper every month because the elastic would just... quit. I’ve had my LeiShape for 3 months now, washed it a dozen times, and it still snaps back like day one. I was hesitant about the price tag, but it’s actually cheaper than buying 5 cheap ones that end up in the trash. It took about 10 days to arrive, which felt like forever, but now that it's here, I get the hype. It’s the last one I’ll ever need."
          },
