        "custom_liquid_Tgzmyi": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "name": "FAQ",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"vr-faq-section\">\n\n  <div class=\"vr-faq-header\">\n    <span class=\"vr-faq-label\">FAQs</span>\n\n    <h2>HAVE QUESTIONS? WE'RE HERE TO HELP!</h2>\n\n    <p>\n      Need help? Write to us at\n      <a href=\"mailto:info@nicshape.com\">\n        info@nicshape.com\n      </a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"vr-faq-list\">\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>What's special about Nicshape Fajas Lift Shape Control Body?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Nicshape Fajas Lift Shape Control Body is designed to offer advanced Colombian-grade shaping, combining aesthetics and functionality.</p><p>Here are the main features that make it special:</p><p><strong>BBL Effect Without Surgery:</strong> Targeted compression zones lift and reshape your glutes naturally, giving you a Brazilian Butt Lift effect without going under the knife.</p><p><strong>FUPA &amp; Apron Belly Control:</strong> The high-compression midsection flattens the lower belly and love handles instantly, redistributing volume to your curves.</p><p><strong>Bust Support From A to DD:</strong> Designed to fit your actual shape, not a mannequin's. Detachable shoulder straps let you customize the fit and adapt to any outfit.</p><p><strong>Post-Surgery &amp; Postpartum Ready:</strong> Full-coverage compression ideal for breast recovery or getting your confidence back after baby, enhancing your natural curves instead of squashing them.</p><p><strong>12+ Hour Comfort:</strong> Firm enough to hold everything in place all day, soft enough that you'll forget you're wearing it. No rolling, no digging, no suffocation.</p><p><strong>Practical Design:</strong> Zipper crotch for easy bathroom breaks without undressing. Because shapewear should work around your life, not against it.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>What size should I choose?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Check your weight:</p><ul><li>XS/S: you weigh between 40 and 63 kg</li><li>M/L: you weigh between 59 and 84 kg</li><li>L/XL: you weigh between 79 and 100 kg</li><li>2XL/3XL: you weigh between 98 and 136 kg</li></ul><p>If you are between two sizes, choose the larger one. You will be more comfortable.</p><p>Example: do you weigh 86 kg and are you 168 cm tall? Choose M/L and they will fit you perfectly.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Will it roll down or shift during the day?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>No. The Fajas Lift Shape Control Body is engineered with a high-waist grip and firm compression that stays in place for 12+ hours — whether you're sitting, bending, or moving all day. No rolling, no adjusting, no fussing.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Will it be obvious that it's not my real body?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>The short answer is no, it shouldn't be noticeable, as long as you wear it correctly. Modern shapewear has moved away from the thick, “reinforced” corsets of the past. That's why this model probably goes unnoticed:</p><p><strong>Fabric density:</strong> The 77% nylon and 23% spandex blend has a high compression ratio but is designed to be thin. Unlike older latex shapewear, this fabric is meant to hug your skin and avoid those annoying bulges.</p><p><strong>The “non-squashed” effect:</strong> Traditional shapewear often flattens the bust or buttocks, which is a telltale sign. Because this model uses “ZoneLock™” technology (targeted compression), it maintains the volume of your curves while smoothing the mid-section, mimicking a natural silhouette.</p><p><strong>Edge design:</strong> Most high-end “All-In-One” swimsuits use laser-cut edges or “flat-lock” seams. This prevents the “sausage casing” effect where the garment ends at the thigh or arm.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>How do you wash them?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <ul><li>Wash them by hand or in the washing machine at 30 degrees Celsius.</li><li>Use the delicate cycle.</li><li>Do not use bleach.</li><li>Do not iron them.</li><li>Avoid using the dryer (or use a low temperature).</li></ul><p>They will remain like new even after many washes.</p><p>Tip: If you have 2-3 pairs, you can alternate them. This way, you will wash them less often and they will last longer.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>How can I tell if they are right for me?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>1. You have issues with “single breasts” or a flat chest</p><p>Most full-body shapers use a single compression panel on the chest, which flattens everything into one shape. If you have an A to DD cup size and want your natural breast shape to be defined rather than “flattened,” this is the right product for you. The fact that it “adapts to your breasts” means that it has elastic recovery specifically designed for the bust area.</p><p>2. You want a “snap” effect but have a “sensitive” waist</p><p>If you've tried shapewear before and felt like you couldn't breathe or sit down, the 23% spandex content is the indicator you need.</p><p>The test: Most standard shapewear contains about 10-15% spandex. With 23%, this garment is designed to be highly elastic. It's perfect for you if you need to wear it for more than 12 hours (such as at a wedding or during a long day at work) without that “constricted” feeling.</p><p>3. Your goal is to “reshape,” not just “flatten.”</p><p>This shapewear is right for you if you have a FUPA or apron belly and your goal is to create a smoother transition to your hips.</p><p>Since it mentions “moving that volume... to the buttocks,” it is designed for those who want a BBL look, meaning it compresses the belly but has “release zones” or lifting technology in the back so that your curves don't disappear.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>What if I don't like them?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>No worries! You have 3 GUARANTEES:</p><p>1. Satisfaction Guaranteed (30 days) Don't like them? We'll refund all your money. No questions asked.</p><p>2. Free Size/Color Exchange Made a mistake? We'll exchange them for free. You only pay for shipping to send them back.</p><p>3. Lifetime Guarantee Did they break? We'll replace them for free. Forever.</p><p>ZERO RISK = Try them with peace of mind. Either you'll fall in love with them, or we'll give you your money back.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>When will my order arrive?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>SHIPPING:</p><p>Your order arrives in 5-7 days.</p><p>WITH EVERY ORDER:</p><p>Tracking number sent to your email so you always know where your package is. Our support team is here if you need anything.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Is it uncomfortable to wear all day?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>That's why it's designed for extended comfort (over 12 hours):</p><p><strong>Adaptive fabric:</strong> The blend of 77% nylon and 23% spandex (a very high percentage of elasticity) creates a “second skin” that moves with you instead of restricting you.</p><p><strong>ZoneLock™ technology:</strong> Unlike “cage” models, this one compresses only where needed (stomach and hips) and molds softly to the chest and buttocks.</p><p><strong>Breathability:</strong> It is described as soft enough to “forget you're wearing it,” allowing you to breathe normally unlike traditional rigid girdles.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .vr-faq-section {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 35px 30px 45px;\n    color: #111;\n    font-family: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-section *,\n  .vr-faq-section *::before,\n  .vr-faq-section *::after {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  /* CABEÇALHO */\n\n  .vr-faq-header {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 32px;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-label {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-header h2 {\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.6vw, 40px);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    letter-spacing: -0.025em;\n    color: #000;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-header p {\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-header a {\n    color: #333;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-underline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n\n  /* LISTA DE PERGUNTAS */\n\n  .vr-faq-list {\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item {\n    display: block;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    border: 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n    background: transparent;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item:first-child {\n    border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 20px;\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 57px;\n    padding: 16px 5px;\n    margin: 0;\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #383838;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    text-align: left;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    list-style: none;\n    text-transform: none;\n    letter-spacing: normal;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary::marker {\n    content: '';\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary::before,\n  .vr-faq-item summary::after {\n    content: none !important;\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid currentColor;\n    outline-offset: -2px;\n  }\n\n  /* SETAS */\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary svg {\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    fill: none;\n    stroke: currentColor;\n    stroke-width: 1.5;\n    stroke-linecap: round;\n    stroke-linejoin: round;\n    transition: transform .2s ease;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item[open] summary svg {\n    transform: rotate(180deg);\n  }\n\n  /* RESPOSTAS */\n\n  .vr-faq-answer {\n    padding: 0 5px 22px;\n    color: #333;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    text-align: left;\n    overflow-wrap: break-word;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-answer p {\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-answer ul {\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-answer li {\n    margin: 0 0 4px;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-answer p:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* MOBILE */\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .vr-faq-section {\n      padding: 30px 15px 40px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-header {\n      margin-bottom: 28px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-header h2 {\n      font-size: 27px;\n      line-height: 1.2;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-header p {\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-item summary {\n      min-height: 57px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      padding: 16px 4px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-answer {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      padding: 0 4px 20px;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .vr-faq-item summary svg {\n      transition: none;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"
